(6689844, 998509, 142483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sinistral_leo:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow, this is too creepy, I hope everyone else sees what I see! This has to be front page! there are a lot of "split mirrored" images in here, but this one includes both sides and is really interesting. It is amazing how different the two sides of a persons face can be. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I hadn''t realised thats what was going on here until I read your comment! Amazing image, should''ve ribboned</td>', 'Originally posted by sinistral_leo: Wow, this is too creepy, I hope everyone else sees what I see! This has to be front page! there are a lot of "split mirrored" images in here, but this one includes both sides and is really interesting. It is amazing how different the two sides of a persons face can be.   I hadn''t realised thats what was going on here until I read your comment! Amazing image, should''ve ribboned', '2012-02-24 00:42:29.000000', NULL, 0),
