(6689928, 998509, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought of something similar to this - you split your face and mirrored each half, yes?  In your case, you look a wee bit different, but close enough to be twins.  In MY case, it combines to make two completely different people!  The "test" of whether someone is "good looking" is if their split face mirror images are the same - in other words, the degree of symmetry in their face.  You pass that test with flying colors!</td>', 'I thought of something similar to this - you split your face and mirrored each half, yes?  In your case, you look a wee bit different, but close enough to be twins.  In MY case, it combines to make two completely different people!  The "test" of whether someone is "good looking" is if their split face mirror images are the same - in other words, the degree of symmetry in their face.  You pass that test with flying colors!', '2012-02-24 01:20:04.000000', NULL, 0),
